          "content": "**Ans**. Draw a line segment $\\mathrm { A B } = 6$ cm. Now using a compass, draw a line perpendicular to AB through its mid-point. Take points C & D on this line from O, such that OC $OD = 3$ cm Join, AC, BC, BD & AD. ACBD is the required square."
